{{!
    @template tool_vae/form_default_submit

    The submit button a form puts first, hidden and out of the order of the keyboard, so that Enter in a field presses a
    button that does nothing.

    Drawn by tool_vae\output\form_default_submit. The template holds no logic and no value.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * none

    Example context (json):
    {
    }
}}
<input type="submit" name="defaultbutton" value="" class="d-none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" />
